Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirm": "Password123",
  "username": "testuser"
}

### Register with wrong informations
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test",
  "password": "test",
  "username": "test"
}

